1 0 0 1 54 696 Tm (AI Recruitment Dashboard, also called RecruitAI in the application UI, is an AI-powered) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 683 Tm (recruitment platform for analyzing and ranking candidates against a job description. It allows a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 670 Tm (recruiter to upload or paste a job description, upload multiple PDF resumes, watch the processing) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 657 Tm (progress in real time, review ranked candidates, shortlist strong matches, export reports, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 644 Tm (send candidate outreach emails.) Tj
