1 0 0 1 54 614 Tm (The project is split into a React frontend and a FastAPI backend. The frontend provides the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 601 Tm (recruiter dashboard experience, while the backend handles PDF processing, resume parsing,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 588 Tm (scoring, persistence, Excel report generation, and email delivery.) Tj
