1 0 0 1 54 784 Tm (Processing happens in phases:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 754 Tm (1. Text extraction) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 739 Tm (   - PDF files are read using embedded text extraction.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 724 Tm (   - If a resume is scanned or image-only, OCR is attempted.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 709 Tm (   - Unreadable resumes are skipped without failing the entire batch unless no resumes can be) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 696 Tm (processed.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 666 Tm (2. Job requirement extraction) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 651 Tm (   - The job description is analyzed to identify required and preferred skills.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 636 Tm (   - Requirements are stored as required, preferred, and combined skill lists.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 606 Tm (3. Semantic similarity) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 591 Tm (   - Resume text is compared with the job description using sentence embeddings.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 576 Tm (   - The configured model is `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 546 Tm (4. Candidate metadata extraction) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 531 Tm (   - The system attempts structured extraction using Ollama.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 516 Tm (   - If Ollama extraction fails, the backend falls back to rule-based extraction.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 501 Tm (   - Extracted metadata includes name, email, phone, skills, experience, education, projects, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 488 Tm (work history.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 458 Tm (5. Skill normalization) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 443 Tm (   - Skills are normalized through a canonical skill mapping.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 428 Tm (   - This helps match variants such as `js`, `JavaScript`, `node`, `Node.js`, and similar) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 415 Tm (aliases.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 385 Tm (6. Score calculation) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 370 Tm (   - Required skill coverage is weighted more heavily than preferred skill coverage.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 355 Tm (   - Semantic similarity is combined with skill alignment.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 340 Tm (   - Experience and education alignment are considered.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 325 Tm (   - A composite score is generated.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
1 0 0 1 54 295 Tm (7. Insight generation) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0.12 0.13 0.16 rg
