1 0 0 1 54 227 Tm (AI Recruitment Dashboard is a full-stack recruiting tool that combines document processing, NLP,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 214 Tm (semantic matching, structured candidate scoring, recruiter workflow management, and email) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 201 Tm (outreach. It is suitable for local development with SQLite, Docker-based development with) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 188 Tm (PostgreSQL, and can be extended toward production with stronger authentication, background job) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 175 Tm (infrastructure, retention policies, and deployment hardening.) Tj
